<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian Dec m/m CPI 0.9 pct, yr/yr 13.1.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian Dec m/m CPI 0.9 pct, yr/yr 13.1.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Lithuania was 0.9 percent month-on-month in December for a 13.1 percent year-on-year rise, the statistics office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN CONSUMER PRICES    Dec '96    Nov '96    Dec '95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   +0.9	 +1.1	 +2.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)     +13.1	+15.0	+35.7</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	    222.6	220.6	196.9</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
